{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STICKS: THE ULTIMATE CONTROLLER AIM TRAINER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eliminate those frustrating &quot;warm-up matches&quot; forever. Sticks is the first aim trainer built from the ground up for controller players, offering unprecedented customization to match the exact feel of any shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362100/extras/5a91c810d74a4930ec2cff00d3ce6c47.poster.avif?t=1743123712\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362100/extras/5a91c810d74a4930ec2cff00d3ce6c47.webm?t=1743123712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362100/extras/5a91c810d74a4930ec2cff00d3ce6c47.mp4?t=1743123712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WHY CONTROLLER PLAYERS CHOOSE STICKS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While other aim trainers treat controllers as an afterthought, Sticks puts controller precision first with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unrivaled Customization</strong> - Over 130 controller-specific settings with input curve precision at every 1% of analog movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game-Matching Perfection</strong> - Replicate the exact feel of any shooter with our advanced Curve Editor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cross-Platform Workshop</strong> - Share and discover community-crafted settings, recoil patterns, and training routines</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Aim Assist System</strong> - Master friction, magnetism, motion tracking, and aim compensation mechanics</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRAIN EXACTLY HOW YOU PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a first-person or third-person shooter enthusiast, Sticks adapts to your style:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom input curves matching any game's unique controller feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design pattern-based or procedural weapon recoil for authentic practice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build structured training playlists for consistent improvement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configure aim assist variables to match your favorite titles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362100/extras/ea12cb1a8556643ac419a68ad207267b.poster.avif?t=1743123712\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362100/extras/ea12cb1a8556643ac419a68ad207267b.webm?t=1743123712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362100/extras/ea12cb1a8556643ac419a68ad207267b.mp4?t=1743123712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POWERED BY THE COMMUNITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only two developers behind Sticks, our cross-platform workshop is the heart of the experience. Players across PC and console can share optimal settings for different games, aiming styles, and training routines\u2014creating a constantly evolving ecosystem of controller excellence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362100/extras/7ceaba4947376e840fc4400e9b2aa6c9.avif?t=1743123712\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362100/extras_big/7ceaba4947376e840fc4400e9b2aa6c9.avif?t=1743123712 width=800 height=422 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FOR CONTENT CREATORS &amp; COMPETITIVE PLAYERS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share custom profiles and training routines with your audience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achieve consistent performance across multiple games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create and distribute specialized playlists through the Workshop</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SEAMLESS INTEGRATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine-tune your settings in real-time alongside your favorite games. With dual-screen support or Windows Snap, make adjustments that instantly transfer to your gameplay experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>START DOMINATING FROM YOUR FIRST MATCH</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Why waste time &quot;warming up&quot; in actual matches? Spend 15-30 minutes in Sticks before your gaming session and hit peak performance from the moment you launch your favorite shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevate your controller game. Master your aim with Sticks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3362100?t=1743123712","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362100/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743123712","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362100/1d9394ec8fbd473df95e61a936adecfbab84ed29/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743123712","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362100/1d9394ec8fbd473df95e61a936adecfbab84ed29/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743123712","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STI