're a first-person or third-person shooter enthusiast, Sticks adapts to your style:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create custom input curves matching any game's unique controller feel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design pattern-based or procedural weapon recoil for authentic practice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build structured training playlists for consistent improvement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Configure aim assist variables to match your favorite titles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362100/extras/ea12cb1a8556643ac419a68ad207267b.poster.avif?t=1743123712\" width=360 height=202 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362100/extras/ea12cb1a8556643ac419a68ad207267b.webm?t=1743123712\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362100/extras/ea12cb1a8556643ac419a68ad207267b.mp4?t=1743123712\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POWERED BY THE COMMUNITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With only two developers behind Sticks, our cross-platform workshop is the heart of the experience. Players across PC and console can share optimal settings for different games, aiming styles, and training routines\u2014creating a constantly evolving ecosystem of controller excellence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362100/extras/7ceaba4947376e840fc4400e9b2aa6c9.avif?t=1743123712\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3362100/extras_big/7ceaba4947376e840fc4400e9b2aa6c9.avif?t=1743123712 width=800 height=422 /></span></p